 ],
 "phrases": [
  {
   "text": "In the eighteen-nineties,",
   "s": 0.14,
   "e": 1.342
  },
  {
   "text": "people were so scared of being buried alive,",
   "s": 1.63,
   "e": 4.038
  },
  {
   "text": "they put bells on their graves.",
   "s": 4.686,
   "e": 6.03
  },
  {
   "text": "A string ran from the coffin,",
   "s": 6.536,
   "e": 7.491
  },
  {
   "text": "up through the dirt,",
   "s": 8.006,
   "e": 8.594
  },
  {
   "text": "to a little bell on top.",
   "s": 8.83,
   "e": 10.371
  },
  {
   "text": "So when Edgar Pratt was buried,",
   "s": 10.885,
   "e": 12.776
  },
  {
   "text": "his bell came with him.",
   "s": 13.307,
   "e": 14.902
  },
  {
   "text": "Two nights later,",
   "s": 15.084,
   "e": 16.163
  },
  {
   "text": "at three in the morning, it rings.",
   "s": 16.4,
   "e": 18.07
  },
  {
   "text": "The neighbor rolls over.",
   "s": 18.6,
   "e": 20.137
  },
  {
   "text": "Probably the wind.",
   "s": 20.393,
   "e": 21.132
  },
  {
   "text": "Then it rings again.",
   "s": 21.299,
   "e": 22.654
  },
  {
   "text": "Harder.",
   "s": 23.287,
   "e": 24.21
  },
  {
   "text": "Soon the whole street is out on their porches.",
   "s": 24.554,
   "e": 25.99
  },
  {
   "text": "You go. No, you go.",
   "s": 26.651,
   "e": 27.788
  },
  {
   "text": "Somebody drags the doctor out of bed.",
   "s": 28.223,
   "e": 30.051
  },
  {
   "text": "Relax, he says.",
   "s": 30.511,
   "e": 31.149
  },
  {
   "text": "Dead bodies move.",
   "s": 31.738,
   "e": 32.663
  },
  {
   "text": "I signed the paper myself.",
   "s": 32.884,
   "e": 34.307
  },
  {
   "text": "But one porch stays dark.",
   "s": 34.587,
   "e": 35.509
  },
  {
   "text": "Edgar's wife is sitting by the door, with a shovel in her lap.",
   "s": 35.974,
   "e": 39.387
  },
  {
   "text": "Because she knows that ring.",
   "s": 39.763,
   "e": 40.876
  },
  {
   "text": "Two short, two long.",
   "s": 41.495,
   "e": 42.228
  },
  {
   "text": "The signal they practiced.",
   "s": 42.404,
   "e": 43.782
  },
  {
   "text": "You see,",
   "s": 44.4,
   "e": 44.805
  },
  {
   "text": "Edgar wasn't dead.",
   "s": 45.045,
   "e": 46.417
  },
  {
   "text": "He owed money to half the town,",
   "s": 46.653,
   "e": 48.001
  },
  {
   "text": "so he faked it.",
   "s": 48.431,
   "e": 48.979
  },
  {
   "text": "She was supposed to dig him up,",
   "s": 49.543,
   "e": 51.031
  },
  {
   "text": "and they'd run.",
   "s": 51.692,
   "e": 52.887
  },
  {
   "text": "Instead, she just sits there. All night. Until sunrise,",
   "s": 53.345,
   "e": 55.454
  },
  {
   "text": "when the bell finally stops.",
   "s": 55.873,
   "e": 57.069
  },
  {
   "text": "And here's the crazy part.",
   "s": 57.195,
   "e": 58.797
  },
  {
   "text": "Edgar's debts got buried with him. And the house? All hers.",
   "s": 59.297,
   "e": 61.508
  }
 ]
}